{"posts":[{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1101","t":"Time for some Compression homework!","a":"Pipc","d":"","n":"#1101","p":45,"im":["29f18a0edd5ba202f552f98b3f6bbf9418997d67"],"m":1101},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1102","t":"I'm also working on the Compression homework right now. It is really interesting how often it seems to happen! Comments appreciated!:)","a":"thetrendsfriend","d":"","n":"#1102","p":45,"im":["c92071acf307869b4896e5e2033fb7b5a6afb5c8"],"m":1102},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1103","t":"Another one: EURGBP H4","a":"thetrendsfriend","d":"","n":"#1103","p":45,"im":["4f9549c7bed7bd3bceb81ff9a17320439fab1ae3"],"m":1103},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1104","t":"Quite new on this forum, been doing my compression homework, seemed to be a bit confusing at first. but i thinkI'm getting the hang of it. Need someone to critique my homework to see if I'm heading in the right direction. Thanks in advance","a":"Lebonardo","d":"","n":"#1104","p":45,"im":["ce13891b9018006922504dae44df9cbe637684df","6625288bd087e60144b3722a75a95f068500e5d4"],"m":1104},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1105","t":"Hey Lebonardo, just my two cents on CP. These zones can be confusing, and you can spend a lot of time drawing and over-focusing on them. I mean it is quite captivating by how price often slides through them, which in turn can lead to considerable moments of time pondering this component of price. No doubt, cool stuff!\n\nFor me, what started to really help me qualify an apparent zone of CP, was what price had done in the past. As CP is part of the approach area, it should be great cause to try and decipher the past along with drawing your zones, too. Of course, it may be quite a bit to digest as you are new. If so, you have my apologies for the confusion.\n\nHere are some good questions to ask\n\nApproach\n\nReaction\n\nBe well!","a":"naascott","d":"","n":"#1105","p":45,"im":["2269d1da9355010333ab5a0158aafebe2f32ad64","3d3f978852adabc0dba6afe4b74f5db1c92d9890"],"m":1105},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1106","t":"Thanks a great deal, that was quite helpful","a":"Lebonardo","d":"","n":"#1106","p":45,"im":[],"m":1106},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1107","t":"Hey Leb, glad I could be of help.","a":"naascott","d":"","n":"#1107","p":45,"im":[],"m":1107},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1108","t":"I can't open compression.pdf is it me or broken link?","a":"TheLastNail","d":"","n":"#1108","p":45,"im":[],"m":1108},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1109","t":"I found beta version on internet, hope there doesn't miss anything important","a":"TheLastNail","d":"","n":"#1109","p":45,"im":[],"m":1109},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1110","t":"Hey TheLastNail, if you google \"compression forex factory\", result number four should be the non beta version.","a":"Pipc","d":"","n":"#1110","p":45,"im":[],"m":1110},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1111","t":"try this one\n\ncompression pdf","a":"roqallo","d":"","n":"#1111","p":45,"im":[],"m":1111},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1112","t":"Hi,\n\nI am relatively new to RTM. I noticed that acronyms are used extensively here. That is really convenient for the veterans who use this site extensively. However, for newbies it can be somewhat confusing. I can figure out most of the acronyms. However, I can't seem to interpret the acronym (or abbreviation, if you will for 'CP'. Would anycare care to deifne 'CP' and elaborate a little as to its purpose?\n\nThank you and have a great day.\n\nCakes1415","a":"Cakes1415","d":"","n":"#1112","p":45,"im":[],"m":1112},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1113","t":":D here you go man:)\n\nand here is screen from the ebook from 1st post (you can download it)","a":"roqallo","d":"","n":"#1113","p":45,"im":["890c5fc4fc15bf46592c16c50d6e98673d212c37","eebb22d91c2770a7ed0e45b54984f76255fa8450"],"m":1113},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1114","t":"Lines are CP, levels are LQ targets.","a":"karlo","d":"","n":"#1114","p":45,"im":["3055cbcaf9cb5011754175604b54be14535ce03b","2c24cc54bc9ece4b5b11fc4311590f97defe6c4b"],"m":1114},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1115","t":"","a":"karlo","d":"","n":"#1115","p":45,"im":["994fd37e30d2fc29d9a83950b493f5ff970f17e2","65346bfba250bc1a1b0629a0df2ceaef7438ff78"],"m":1115},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1116","t":"","a":"karlo","d":"","n":"#1116","p":45,"im":["14d5d337ad5b5e1f1f5c403505f95936ca1cb931","4ef507fdeb4539a7895c00c7f8e730d1f8341b85"],"m":1116},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1117","t":"start of my homeworks from CP. No history at the moment, but current frame because it can involve opportunities. HTF to highlight main PAs\n\n..the same, but a slightly different pont of view\n\n..nostalgy for comments ( slaps as well..) by upper steps of the ladder.....but the main thing is to do, always. Anything else will be consequent eventually","a":"althoufx","d":"","n":"#1117","p":45,"im":["3f192b546225d891a58dcc54967a112abd098f70","549acd961fce6e66d0aa4f1697bc71db8eaa7803"],"m":1117},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1118","t":"...more CPs. highlighted zones towards LQ ( CPLQ) go.","a":"althoufx","d":"","n":"#1118","p":45,"im":["828c5a880accd71e4a54c7500f16da0106d3438d","e0bc4fbc7d06998746a7451de8bfc7a386b2e9f2"],"m":1118},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1119","t":"Hi, I am very new to trading so do correct me if i am wrong and I hope all of you here could give me some feedback/comments. could anybody answer my questions as writtern on the chart? thank you very much","a":"azrisilmi","d":"","n":"#1119","p":45,"im":["2c3ce050f6c29853c13519718fdf186f17862119"],"m":1119},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1120","t":"Homework on Compression.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","n":"#1120","p":45,"im":["ed2c665c89726ca18fc9a6cd9f2b30fe1c6a0d13"],"m":1120},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1121","t":"Homework on Compression.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","n":"#1121","p":45,"im":["2c17fbeedd0789a5d79f7ad052d2e37fddf72768"],"m":1121},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1122","t":"Ok, this is my HW for CP. I also marked some untouched zones (clean S and D). Feel free to comment.","a":"deenius","d":"","n":"#1122","p":45,"im":["ed86f97230838b565cf6df9ae9c56da29809b2d8","5e74a27fb28c1f1cedb724bee6d9bdab30f2f1d4","33c9cb27ee36815dbeb246da24136630a9ceb8c1"],"m":1122},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1123","t":"azrisilmi wrote: Hi, I am very new to trading so do correct me if i am wrong and I hope all of you here could give me some feedback/comments. could anybody answer my questions as writtern on the chart? thank you very much\n\nI wouldn't consider this CP to have been entered until that lower blue line has been crossed.","a":"ZeeDeveel","d":"","n":"#1123","p":45,"im":["2c3ce050f6c29853c13519718fdf186f17862119"],"m":1123},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1124","t":"Hi Azrisilmi, Those are perfect Compression. Please go through the below Image to understand the reason for price not entering the Compression after hitting it's limit couple of times.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","n":"#1124","p":45,"im":["5b16ef040c47c0e29643707336932f85e7ce65ba"],"m":1124},{"id":"aboutcompression_p45_1125","t":"hi all. i am new in RTM. i am reading about CP and i have a quastion. how we can figure out, our cp react to which level, or when cp will work. thanks for your comment.","a":"ofshen","d":"","n":"#1125","p":45,"im":["aacde6c959c7615e162fd792bd25c78aa55e4260"],"m":1125}],"images":[{"k":"29f18a0edd5ba202f552f98b3f6bbf9418997d67","t":"assets/thumbs/29f18a0edd5ba202f552f98b3f6bbf9418997d67.webp","f":"assets/images/29f18a0edd5ba202f552f98b3f6bbf9418997d67.png","w":1480,"h":752,"b":129892,"o":"29f18a0edd5ba202f552f98b3f6bbf9418997d67.png","p":45,"pid":"aboutcompression_p45_1101"},{"k":"c92071acf307869b4896e5e2033fb7b5a6afb5c8","t":"assets/thumbs/c92071acf307869b4896e5e2033fb7b5a6afb5c8.webp","f":"assets/images/c92071acf307869b4896e5e2033fb7b5a6afb5c8.jpeg","w":1366,"h":649,"b":108803,"o":"c92071acf307869b4896e5e2033fb7b5a6afb5c8.jpeg","p":45,"pid":"aboutcompression_p45_1102"},{"k":"4f9549c7bed7bd3bceb81ff9a17320439fab1ae3","t":"assets/thumbs/4f9549c7bed7bd3bceb81ff9a17320439fab1ae3.webp","f":"assets/images/4f9549c